Package: zabbix-agentd
Submenu: Zabbix
Version: 7.0.30-r2
Depends: +libc +BUILD_NLS:libiconv-full +libevent2-pthreads +libpcre2 +zlib +ZABBIX_CURL:libcurl +ZABBIX_CURL_GNUTLS:libcurl-gnutls +ZABBIX_GNUTLS:libgnutls +ZABBIX_LDAP:libopenldap +ZABBIX_NETSNMP:libnetsnmp-ssl +ZABBIX_OPENSSL:libopenssl
Conflicts: 
Menu-Depends: 
Provides: @zabbix-agentd-any @zabbix-agentd-any zabbix-agentd-ssl zabbix-agentd-openssl
Build-Variant: full
Default-Variant: full
Section: admin
Category: Administration
Repository: base
Title: Zabbix agentd (full/with TLS)
Maintainer: Daniel F. Dickinson <dfdpublic@wildtechgarden.ca>
Require-User: zabbix-agent=53:zabbix-agent=53
Source: zabbix-7.0.30.tar.gz
License: AGPL-3.0-only
LicenseFiles: COPYING
CPE-ID: cpe:/a:zabbix:zabbix
URL: https://www.zabbix.com/
Type: ipkg
Description: Zabbix is a software that monitors numerous parameters of a network and the
health and integrity of servers, virtual machines, applications, services,
databases, websites, the cloud and more. Zabbix offers excellent reporting and
data visualization features based on the stored data.
.
Only one variant may be installed per binary (e.g. agent and agentd-basic cannot
both be installed on the same system).
.
Provides the full functionality available in OpenWrt with OpenSSL.
Includes NetSNMP, cURL, and OpenLDAP support.
Requires a database server.
.
Provides 'Zabbix Agent'.
.
Note that 'Zabbix Agent' does not directly use the database, but sends data to
a 'Zabbix Server' or a 'Zabbix Proxy', which writes to a database.
@@
Config:
	source "feeds/packages/admin/zabbix/Config.in"
@@

